//Jin.npc

*J_NAME		"Adventurer Jin"

*J_CHAT		"Hello! I'm Jin. I've traveled all over the Priston continent." 
*J_CHAT		"I had traveled for few years, but now I've been doing volunteer work after many monsters came out."
*J_CHAT		"I have a twin sister. We are travelers, and now we are apart. I wonder where she is~ "